"│                                                     ││  ✓  added and up to date                  │"
"│                                                     ││  +  will be added                         │"
"│                                                     ││  ?  will be added once you've checked it  │"
"│                                                     ││  ↑  will be updated to a newer version    │"
"│                                                     ││  −  will be removed (no longer needed)    │"
"│                                                     ││  ≠  you changed it, so Aurora leaves it   │"
"│                                                     ││  alone                                    │"
"│                                                     ││  !  already here and not added by Aurora, │"
